return {
    ["\n《廷根酒徒威廉与血腥奇遇记：身为醉酒无赖的他发现廷根的吸血鬼巢穴，他的房东还有城中的工厂大王与银行家实际上是吸血鬼；讲述他如何独力以木桩刺穿吸血鬼的贪利之心，由此成为鲁恩最负盛名的吸血鬼猎人的故事》\n\n作者：克利夫·威廉\n\n<Letter_Highlight_HW>能火！！！</>\n\n该死的巴兹尔，到处说我坏话，你只能活两个章节！\n<Hide stylename=\"Transparent\" id=\"#161\">这一段内容是编的这一段内容是编的这一段</>\n<Delete id=\"#158\">猫不会说话。</>\n<Delete id=\"#158\">鸽子也是。</>"] = "\n\"Tingen Drunkard William and the Bloody Adventure: As a drunken rogue, he discovers a vampire nest in Tingen; his landlord and the city's factory tycoon and banker are actually vampires; telling the story of how he single-handedly pierces the vampires' greed with a wooden stake, thus becoming Loen's most renowned vampire hunter\"\n\nAuthor: Cliff William\n\n<Letter_Highlight_HW>It will be a hit!!!</>\n\nDamn Basil, talking bad about me everywhere, you can only live for two chapters!\n<Hide stylename=\"Transparent\" id=\"#161\">This part of the content is made up this part of the content is made up this</>\n<Delete id=\"#158\">Cats cannot talk.</>\n<Delete id=\"#158\">Neither can pigeons.</>",
    ["\n从前有一个小女孩，只有一只眼睛，没有妈妈。\n\n有一天，月亮送给她一只兔子。 兔子说：我帮你找妈妈。 小女孩说：好呀好呀。\n\n兔子找来了第一个妈妈， 把她变成了一只蝴蝶。 小女孩说：太好啦，蝴蝶妈妈不会跑走了。\n\n兔子又找来第二个，第三个，第四个…… 蝴蝶越来越多， 小女孩的口袋里装满了翅膀的声音。\n\n有人问她：你不难过吗？ 小女孩想了想，说： 难过的时候，我就数一数蝴蝶， 一只，两只，三只…… 数着数着就好了。\n\n【全文完】"] = "\nOnce upon a time, there was a little girl who had only one eye and no mother.\n\nOne day, the moon gave her a rabbit. The rabbit said: I will help you find your mother. The little girl said: Yay, yay.\n\nThe rabbit found the first mother and turned her into a butterfly. The little girl said: That's great, Butterfly Mother won't run away.\n\nThe rabbit found a second, a third, a fourth... There were more and more butterflies, and the little girl's pockets were filled with the sound of wings.\n\nSomeone asked her: Aren't you sad? The little girl thought for a moment and said: When I feel sad, I count the butterflies, one, two, three... and as I count, I feel better.\n\n[End of Story]",
